        "@value": "Cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,27-triol [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + NAD+ [cytosol] => 4CHOL7a,27DONE [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + H+ [cytosol] + NADH [cytosol]"
