        "@value": "VLCFA [peroxisomal matrix] + CoA-SH [peroxisomal matrix] + ATP [peroxisomal matrix] => VLCFA-CoA [peroxisomal matrix] + AMP [peroxisomal matrix] + PPi [peroxisomal matrix]"
      }
    ],
    "https://systemomicslab.github.io/MSLipidMapper/ontology/evidenceJson": [
      {
        "@value": "{\"catalystActivity\": [{\"catalyzedEvent\": [10916853], \"className\": \"CatalystActivity\", \"dbId\": 10916851, \"displayName\": \"very long-chain fatty acid-CoA ligase activity of SLC27A2 [peroxisomal membrane]\", \"schemaClass\": \"CatalystActivity\"}], \"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"compartment\": [{\"accession\": \"0005782\", \"className\": \"Compartment\", \"databaseName\": \"GO\", \"dbId\": 17951, \"definition\": \"The volume contained within the membranes of a peroxisome; in many cells the matrix contains a crystalloid core largely composed of urate oxidase.\", \"displayName\": \"peroxisomal matrix\", \"name\": \"peroxisomal matrix\", \"schemaClass\": \"Compartment\", \"url\": \"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/QuickGO/term/GO:0005782\"}], \"dbId\": 10916853, \"displayName\": \"SLC27A2-mediated ligation of peroxisomal fatty acid and CoASH\", \"evidenceType\": {\"className\": \"EvidenceType\", \"dbId\": 9990865, \"displayName\": \"inferred by electronic annotation\", \"name\": [\"inferred by electronic annotation\", \"IEA\"], \"schemaClass\": \"EvidenceType\"}, \"input\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"consumedByEvent\": [10916853], \"dbId\": 389573, \"displayName\": \"ATP [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ATP\", \"ATP(4-)\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-389573\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-389573.3\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"consumedByEvent\": [10916853], \"dbId\": 193514, \"displayName\": \"CoA-SH [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CoA-SH\", \"coenzyme A(4-)\", \"coenzyme A\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-193514\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-193514.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"consumedByEvent\": [10916853], \"dbId\": 9914044, \"displayName\": \"VLCFA [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"VLCFA\", \"very long-chain fatty acid anion\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9914044\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9914044.1\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"SLC27A2-mediated ligation of peroxisomal fatty acid and CoASH\", \"a very long-chain fatty acid + ATP + CoA => a very long-chain fatty acyl-CoA + AMP + diphosphate\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 389620, \"displayName\": \"AMP [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"AMP\", \"adenosine 5'-monophosphate(2-)\", \"adenosine 5'-monophosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10916853], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-389620\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-389620.6\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 389593, \"displayName\": \"PPi [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PPi\", \"diphosphate(3-)\", \"Pyrophosphate\", \"diphosphoric acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10916853], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-389593\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-389593.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9914131, \"displayName\": \"VLCFA-CoA [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"VLCFA-CoA\", \"very long-chain fatty acyl-CoA(4-)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10916853], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9914131\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9914131.1\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10857173, \"displayName\": \"Peroxisomal uptake of very long-chain fatty acyl CoA\", \"followingEvent\": [10916853], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Peroxisomal uptake of very long-chain fatty acyl CoA\", \"a very long-chain fatty acyl-CoA(out) + ATP + 2 H2O => a very long-chain fatty acid(in) + ADP + CoA + 2 H(+)\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Drosophila melanogaster\", \"stId\": \"R-DME-390393\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DME-390393.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"DME\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 56210, \"displayName\": \"Drosophila melanogaster\", \"name\": [\"Drosophila melanogaster\", \"D. melanogaster\", \"Dm\", \"fruit fly\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"7227\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Drosophila melanogaster\", \"stId\": \"R-DME-9914143\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DME-9914143.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\"}]}"
      }
