        "@value": "PalmCoA [mitochondrial matrix] + H+ [mitochondrial matrix] + FAD [mitochondrial matrix] => trans-Hexadec-2-enoyl-CoA [mitochondrial matrix] + FADH2 [mitochondrial matrix]"
