transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10842640, \"displayName\": \"DHAP is converted to G3P by GPD1/GPD1L\", \"followingEvent\": [10842582], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"DHAP is converted to G3P by GPD1/GPD1L\", \"Conversion of Dihydroxyacetone Phosphate to Glycerol -3- phosphate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Drosophila melanogaster\", \"stId\": \"R-DME-75889\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DME-75889.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"DME\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 56210, \"displayName\": \"Drosophila melanogaster\", \"name\": [\"Drosophila melanogaster\", \"D. melanogaster\", \"Dm\", \"fruit fly\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"7227\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Drosophila melanogaster\", \"stId\": \"R-DME-75886\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DME-75886.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\"}]}"
      }
