        "@value": "{\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"compartment\": [{\"accession\": \"0005788\", \"className\": \"Compartment\", \"databaseName\": \"GO\", \"dbId\": 17957, \"definition\": \"The volume enclosed by the membranes of the endoplasmic reticulum.\", \"displayName\": \"endoplasmic reticulum lumen\", \"name\": \"endoplasmic reticulum lumen\", \"schemaClass\": \"Compartment\", \"url\": \"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/QuickGO/term/GO:0005788\"}], \"dbId\": 10901230, \"displayName\": \"DBI, ACBD7 bind MCFA-CoA and LCFA-CoA\", \"evidenceType\": {\"className\": \"EvidenceType\", \"dbId\": 9990865, \"displayName\": \"inferred by electronic annotation\", \"name\": [\"inferred by electronic annotation\", \"IEA\"], \"schemaClass\": \"EvidenceType\"}, \"goBiologicalProcess\": {\"accession\": \"0006637\", \"className\": \"GO_BiologicalProcess\", \"databaseName\": \"GO\", \"dbId\": 8047, \"definition\": \"The chemical reactions and pathways involving acyl-CoA, any derivative of coenzyme A in which the sulfhydryl group is in thiolester linkage with an acyl group.\", \"displayName\": \"acyl-CoA metabolic process\", \"name\": \"acyl-CoA metabolic process\", \"schemaClass\": \"GO_BiologicalProcess\", \"url\": \"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/QuickGO/term/GO:0006637\"}, \"input\": [{\"className\": \"Set\", \"consumedByEvent\": [10901230], \"dbId\": 10901226, \"displayName\": \"DBI, (ACBD7) [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 3, \"name\": [\"DBI, (ACBD7)\"], \"schemaClass\": \"CandidateSet\", \"speciesName\": \"Drosophila melanogaster\", \"stId\": \"R-DME-8848239\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DME-8848239.1\"}, {\"className\": \"Set\", \"consumedByEvent\": [10901230], \"dbId\": 8848288, \"displayName\": \"MCFA-CoA, LCFA-CoA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 2, \"name\": [\"MCFA-CoA, LCFA-CoA\", \"medium/long chain fatty acyl-CoA\"], \"schemaClass\": \"DefinedSet\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-8848288\", \"stIdVersion